Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(605,330)\fs55}「妈妈」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.73,0:09:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(965,760)}「那就早点说啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(762,760)}「根本没听」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(950,760)}「不知为何 女经理诞生」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:49.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,760)}「第二天」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1420,760)}「拒绝。」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.45,0:16:15.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(543,760)}「小攻？」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(962,760)}「数天后」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:33.61,Default-furigana,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1315,520)\fs45\3c&H131413&}「我好高兴啊…雅」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:33.61,Default-furigana,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1315,590)\fs45\3c&H131413&}「现在…还不行…」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:33.32,Default-furigana,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs55\3c&H181818&}谁啊？谁啊？谁啊？
